{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kingdom of Yaks is in peril.</strong><br>Answer the king\u2019s call, take up your weapons, and set out to defend the crown. From plains to deserts, from mountains to cursed lands, face bandits and drive back the creatures that come from beyond the borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as one of 5 unique heroes</strong> and engage in intense 1\u2011on\u20111 duels where every card you play can change the course of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck\u2011builder rogue\u2011lite RPG</strong> \u2013 Build your deck from over 70 hero\u2011specific cards and 58 universal cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u2011on\u20111 battles</strong> \u2013 Face enemies with varied actions: attack, defense, buff, debuff, healing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/aa2a3881075ccef4955bab0f640a1804.poster.avif?t=1774015506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/aa2a3881075ccef4955bab0f640a1804.webm?t=1774015506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/aa2a3881075ccef4955bab0f640a1804.mp4?t=1774015506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG stats</strong> \u2013 Critical hit, accuracy, dodge, defense, healing, armor, thorns\u2026 all directly influence your cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic anticipation</strong> \u2013 Predict enemy intentions through your Anticipation stat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>400+ items to discover</strong> \u2013 Including 230 commons, with a wide range of cloth, leather, and plate armor that any class can equip. Create unique builds \u2014 a cloth\u2011wearing tank to boost electric damage, or a plate\u2011clad mage to withstand heavy blows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/51e34292a3b723722ad24c474f4092db.poster.avif?t=1774015506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/51e34292a3b723722ad24c474f4092db.webm?t=1774015506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/51e34292a3b723722ad24c474f4092db.mp4?t=1774015506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent loot</strong> \u2013 Keep your gold and equipment even after death, progressing run after run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 unique biomes and more</strong> \u2013 Grasslands, snowfields, desert \u2014 each with its own enemies, events, and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative mini\u2011events</strong> \u2013 Choose between multiple options that can alter your deck, your stats, or your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized 3D visuals</strong> \u2013 Animated battles where your hero moves and strikes in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/65c1293ca1aff76f9c7b1b849f2eb85e.poster.avif?t=1774015506\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005380/extras/65c1293ca1aff76f9c7b1b849f2eb85e.webm?t=1774015506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: